    "termio can teach the agents you run (Claude Code, Codex, …) a `termio sessions` command so they can see, drive, and read each other's sessions in a project.\n\nEnabling adds a short note to your ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md and installs status hooks. You can turn it off anytime in Settings ▸ Agents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "termio 可以教你运行的 Agent（Claude Code、Codex 等）使用 `termio sessions` 命令，让它们在项目中查看、驱动并读取彼此的会话。\n\n启用后会在你的 ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md 中添加一段简短说明并安装状态 hooks。你可以随时在“设置 ▸ Agents”中将其关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
